  "description": "**All enquiries via email with references to rentals@dngelladunphy.com***\n\nSoutheast Home Hunters Ltd are delighted to present this beautifully maintained two-bedroom duplex apartment to the rental market.\n\nThe property is presented in excellent condition throughout and offers bright, spacious and well-proportioned accommodation over two levels. The duplex layout creates a great sense of space, while the attractive river views provide a peaceful and pleasant outlook.\n\nAccommodation includes a comfortable living area, well-appointed kitchen, two generous bedrooms and bathroom facilities. The property has been very well cared for and is ready for immediate occupation.\n\nIdeally suited to tenants seeking a high-quality home in a convenient location, this apartment combines comfortable modern living with a lovely riverside setting.",
